docs/design/features/2026-08-20-t1435-dual-profile-ram-access-contract.md:48:| RAM Role history | `authorization_role_versions` | `(role_id, version)` 唯一；保存规范化 permissions JSON、risk snapshot、actor、timestamp；只追加 |
